<http://data.silknow.org/object/7113dda6-911c-3f32-b9fd-a3df2cd3bd7b>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "One side of a pair of boots made of leather lined with bright red and green woollen felt appliqué with elaborate floral motifs embroidered or couched in a combination of silk, metal, gold and woollen threads on its upper and its cuff, with a blue-painted hemp layered at the top of the cuff. With a front vamp lined with magenta cotton/woollen ends, and edged with chagrin (or shagreen) between its upper and wooden sole and 4 cm high heel which is layered with leather at the bottom. Most likely worn by women from the city of Yarkand (also known as Shache in Chinese) at festive occasions."@en , "One side of a pair of woman's boots made of leather lined with woollen felt appliqué and embroidered, from Shache (Yarkand), China, ca. 1873"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/fa290eb8-9a86-3aaf-966a-f944e2da5d9e> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "One side of a pair of boots made of leather lined with bright red and green woollen felt appliqué with elaborate floral motifs embroidered or couched in a combination of silk, metal, gold and woollen threads on its upper and its cuff, with a blue-painted hemp layered at the top of the cuff. With a front vamp lined with magenta cotton/woollen ends, and edged with chagrin (or shagreen) between its upper and wooden sole and 4 cm high heel which is layered with leather at the bottom. Most likely worn by women from the city of Yarkand (also known as Shache in Chinese) at festive occasions."@en , "One side of a pair of woman's boots made of leather lined with woollen felt appliqué and embroidered, from Shache (Yarkand), China, ca. 1873"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/7113dda6-911c-3f32-b9fd-a3df2cd3bd7b/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7113dda6-911c-3f32-b9fd-a3df2cd3bd7b/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7113dda6-911c-3f32-b9fd-a3df2cd3bd7b/dimension/3> ;
